          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "> **Presence \u2260 Convergence.** A writer or reader being _present_ means Collector Service can see it \u2014 not that it has matched any peer. The **Match Status** panels below show `publication_matched_current_count` / `subscription_matched_current_count` as the intended convergence indicators \u2014 _these metrics are not yet exported by RTI Monitoring Library 2.0 and will show \"No data\" until RTI adds support._ Until then, use presence counts + zero `incompatible_qos` as a proxy for convergence.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.1.4",
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
